===A5_S4_D5===
// attach to amelia
Noelle: (Oh, and she finally remembered Cillian’s name!) #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile
Narrator: Before you both head to sleep, Amelia turns back to say something to you, her eyes trained on the campfire.
Amelia: …As for where I went, while you were decoding artifacts. #portrait:AmeliaNeutral
Amelia: I was visiting where my gran and gramps used to live. #portrait:AmeliaNeutral
Narrator: You stay silent. Amelia’s tail sways left, then right.
Amelia: I was the runt of my birth-family, so… as some creatures do, they leave their runts out to fend for themselves. #portrait:AmeliaNeutral
Amelia: I was probably meant to grow up wilder, but Gran found me and took me in. She used to live in the human settlement, but her and Gramps retired with a little cottage near the mountains. #portrait:AmeliaHappy
Amelia: They were pretty old for humans, though, so… #portrait:AmeliaNeutral
Noelle: (After a while, Amelia must’ve been left alone… again.) #portrait:NoelleUm
Amelia: Anyways, that’s why I wandered off today. To tidy up their hut. #portrait:AmeliaHappy
Amelia: Everything’s in place, but I guess the flood will wash it out, soon, so… #portrait:AmeliaShut
Noelle: Did you want to pick up anything from there? We can definitely bring it up the mountains. #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile
Amelia: …I’m not sure. I’ll decide after you sort out your big mystery. #portrait:AmeliaShut
Amelia: Let’s go to bed. Big day of demanding things from the humans tomorrow. #portrait:AmeliaNeutral
Narrator: You smile.
Noelle: Yeah. Have a good night. #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile
// sleep at Amelia hut to transition to day 6
